1) Document files

   COPYRIGHT, COPYRIGHT.j, README,
   HMMGene.doc, HMMView.doc, HMMRecog.doc

2) Source files

   Makefile, ga.h, hmm-gene.h, hmm.h, sp2mp.h,
   ga.c, ga_dmutation.c, ga_fitness.c, ga_imutation.c, 
   ga_misc.c, ga_pmutation.c, ga_recombination.c, 
   ga_scaling.c, ga_selection.c, 
   hmm-gene.c, hmm-gene_misc.c, hmm_backward.c, 
   hmm_baum.c, hmm_forward.c, hmm_misc.c, hmm_recog.c, 
   hmm_train.c, hmm_viterbi.c, 
   sp2mp.c, timer.c, utils.c, xutils.c 
   HMMView

3) Sample sequence data files

   learn.seq, recog.seq

4) Sample condition files

   env.cnd, ga.cnd, hmm.cnd

