-----------

[1] Yada,T., Ishikawa,M., Tanaka,H. and Asai,K. (1995)
    A New Method for the Extraction of Signal Patterns
    in DNA Sequences, In Proc. of the 4th Int. Conf. on
    Intelligent System for Molecular Biology, (in press).


